        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=76,\\ b=44$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(1+\\sqrt{3})^5&=1+5\\sqrt{3}+10(3)+10(3\\sqrt{3})+5(9)+9\\sqrt{3}\\\\&=1+5\\sqrt{3}+30+30\\sqrt{3}+45+9\\sqrt{3}\\\\&=76+44\\sqrt{3}\\end{align*}$$\nHence $a=76$ and $b=44$.",
