        "answer": {
          "short": "$a=16,\\ b=-8$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}(1-\\sqrt{5})^3&=1+3(-\\sqrt{5})+3(5)+(-5\\sqrt{5})\\\\&=1-3\\sqrt{5}+15-5\\sqrt{5}\\\\&=16-8\\sqrt{5}\\end{align*}$$\nHence $a=16$ and $b=-8$.",
